# Parrot Cage (Hyacinth Macaw) from the Bloodsail pirates of Stranglethorn.
# Sources: items.json and the TDB's loot (eight Bloodsail kinds, 0.02% per
# kill, the Swabby 0.04%; Classic drop data); npcs.json (the camps: Raiders
# and Mages on the coast north of Booty Bay, Swashbucklers and Warlocks on the
# Wild Shore south of it, Sea Dogs, Deckhands, Swabbies and Elder Magi on the
# ships off the southern tip); Forever client 1.60.1.70532 (it can be traded).

step Bloodsail pirates
  tip Every Bloodsail pirate on the Stranglethorn coast (level 39-45) can drop it, but only about once in 5,000 kills; the Swabbies on the ships off the southern tip, about once in 2,500. That is a grind of many hours, so most players kill pirates while doing something else there, or buy the cage on the Auction House. The waypoint is the Swashbucklers' and Warlocks' camp on the Wild Shore, south of Booty Bay. Every pirate kill also lowers your Bloodsail Buccaneers standing.
  collect 8494 @27.2,83.0             -- Bloodsail camp, the Wild Shore
